#. Description of the plugin
#: diluxone-offload.php
msgid ""
"Move your WordPress media to cloud object storage and serve it from there. "
"Replaces /uploads/ transparently via a PHP stream wrapper."
msgstr ""
"Déplacez vos médias WordPress vers un stockage objet dans le cloud et servez-"
"les depuis celui-ci. Remplace /uploads/ de façon transparente via un wrapper "
"de flux PHP."

